# ── Secret backups, renames and copied git stores (estate secret sweep 9 Sep 2026) ──
# On 9 Sep 2026 the auto-git stop hook committed a renamed Xero token file
# (config/xero_tokens.json.consumed-bak-021605) because only the exact original
# name was ignored. Every backup or rename shape of a secret is ignored here,
# and so is a copied .git store, which can carry every secret ever committed.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*-bak-*
*.orig
*.backup
*.old
*.consumed-*
.env*
!.env.*.example
*.pem
*.key
.git.zeroed-*/
